# verb|form|locked|r6|note
info|a value/structure exists|1|0|struct var const
map|one to one shape kept|1|0|R4 map-math or map-table
order|rearrange by key|1|0|sort is R3
repeat|apply along an axis|1|0|axis is R4
decision|compare then take a control path|1|0|not a table
invert|undo a known transform|1|0|peel T^-1
compare|produce a relation across values|1|0|not a path choice
theorize|claim about an event then score|1|1|R6 thought-model
occam|prefer shallower wrap unless thrown|1|1|R6 strategy
hegelian|determinate negation of a claim|1|1|R6 strategy
